# Build-only dependency input (v4.9.0).
#
# The controller generates the hash-locked build-requirements.lock from this
# file with the exact pinned uv (0.12.5). Build jobs install that lock with
# --require-hashes and run `python -m build --no-isolation` so the build
# backend is byte-reproducible — no floating `build`/`pip-tools` installs.
# pip itself is pinned here so builder venvs end with an exact hash-pinned
# pip (no `pip install --upgrade pip` anywhere in the build path).
build
hatchling
pip
